  "kv1.7:3.14": "Āmantā. ",
  "kv1.7:3.15": "Atītaṃ khandhādhātuāyatanaṃ atītaṃ atthīti? ",
  "kv1.7:3.16": "Na h' evaṃ vattabbe --pe-- 4. ",
