  "kv1.7:9.7": "paccuppannaṃ rūpaṃ khandhādhātuāyatanaṃ, paccuppannaṃ rūpaṃ atthīti? ",
  "kv1.7:9.8": "Āmantā. ",
  "kv1.7:9.9": "Atītaṃ rūpaṃ khandhādhātuāyatanaṃ, atītaṃ rūpaṃ atthīti? ",
