  "kv1.7:13.9": "atītaṃ viññāṇaṃ dhātu --pe-- ",
  "kv1.7:13.10": "atītaṃ viññāṇaṃ khandhādhātuāyatanan ti? ",
  "kv1.7:13.11": "Āmantā. ",
  "kv1.7:13.12": "Atītaṃ viññāṇaṃ atthīti? ",
  "kv1.7:13.13": "Na h' evaṃ vattabbe --pe-- 14. Anāgatā vedanā, anāgatā saññā, anāgatā saṃkhārā, ",
  "kv1.7:14.1": "anāgataṃ viññāṇaṃ khandho ti? ",
